  "description": "MSTR finally broke out. Here’s why I’m still staying away. Plus, leave your ticker for tomorrow’s Midweek Movers.",
  "body_html": "<p>If you are wanting me to review a stock you are in or are thinking about:</p><h4><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-342641190?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Leave your stock ticker request here (click here)</a></h4><p>The Midweek movers has become one of our most successful series, with the average return being 25.9% for the 1st place stocks this year. </p><p>Our last episode was on September 9th. You can see the<strong> <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-average-midweek-mover-stock-is?r=4z8lgl\">prior stock winner, which is still in buy range, here. (click here)</a></strong></p><div><hr></div><p>Microstrategy, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$MSTR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>, keeps coming up in conversation. We have been bullish on Bitcoin for several weeks now, and I continue to be bullish. Naturally, if BTC is going up, it is normal for MSTR to go up as well. Considering price action is above the 200 day moving average, this is when you do NOT bet against an asset.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png\" width=\"1378\" height=\"763\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:763,&quot;width&quot;:1378,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:202333,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/216911875?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!32UV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9e6341f0-d347-4c94-bd89-462675a23c4c_1378x763.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Price action finally breaks above the 200 day moving average, gapping up. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Does that mean I will buy Microstrategy?</p><h4>It will be a cold day in hell when I buy MSTR 🥶</h4><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Again, just because I don’t like a company, that meets none of my investing criteria, does not mean it can’t or won’t go up. Trend is friend right now. </p><p>However… you are playing with a ticking time bomb 💣</p><ul><li><p>Michael Saylor lost nearly everything in the Dot-com bubble.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a><a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a> He did not have 1 single earnings beat as CEO of Microstrategy. Not one. </p></li><li><p>Microstrategy fundamentals are atrocious. Consistently negative earnings and negative revenue.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-3\" href=\"#footnote-3\" target=\"_self\">3</a></p></li><li><p>Anytime leverage is involved, it is not if, but when, the market implodes a company.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-4\" href=\"#footnote-4\" target=\"_self\">4</a> Think about Leopold Aschenbrenner<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-5\" href=\"#footnote-5\" target=\"_self\">5</a> getting liquidated type of situation. No one, including him, thought that would happen. It did. </p></li></ul><p>Trend is up… go with that until price action says otherwise. But <em><strong>I would not play with MSTR without a consistent stop strategy going forward.</strong></em> Where will MSTR go? Who knows, maybe it achieves all time highs again. Maybe $365. Endless possibilities. </p><p>You do what is best for you. </p><div><hr></div><p>Overall, market looks fine. S&amp;P 500 continues to trend upwards towards all time highs along with the NASDAQ. Its a steady, good, quiet day. Nothing to worry about. </p><p>Don’t forget to leave your ticker for review tomorrow. </p><h4>Be sure to like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 This really helps fight AI slop!</h4><p>Swing by the main chat if you have any questions, and thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W3S9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8add7fc9-8edc-4748-ba33-360428e75ee1_1206x1206.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://finance.yahoo.com/news/michael-saylor-lost-big-dot-221043707.html?guccounter=1&amp;guce_referrer=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS8&amp;guce_referrer_sig=AQAAAEvKGoei7ksAbxluxOiL2CRE2Jx_-W0RSnK-SovVp63Rfu3MG73bNArhuiVE5S7J1gNGG6Uyk9u-FpfDC9nVwtXyY4rYisyaUqo-CcQ6BMJQExjoY1uZTGpEZTh55KiYRafjryMEjDvZsv5JVTTlXc66zzJxvwn4DbPQfNBb_M8X</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://fortune.com/2022/08/03/michael-saylor-microstrategy-stock-bitcoin-bet-debt-outlook/</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-3\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-3\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">3</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSTR/financials/</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-4\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-4\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">4</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.vaneck.com/us/en/blogs/digital-assets/matthew-sigel-deconstructing-strategy-mstr-premium-leverage-and-capital-structure/</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-5\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-5\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">5</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.linkedin.com/posts/theo101_a-billionaire-liquidated-almost-20b-during-share-7488529455053938689-yr2v/</p></div></div>",
